<h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
<p><strong>Version 1.0, dated 16 October 2026.</strong> These terms govern use of AcxiomCRM, a role-based customer relationship application operated from 123 Business Street, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India (contact: <a href="mailto:support@example.in">support@example.in</a>, <a href="tel:+911234567890">+91 12345 67890</a>).</p>

<h2>1. Service scope</h2>
<p>AcxiomCRM provides customer, lead, opportunity, follow-up and activity management with dashboards, reports, audit logging and role-based access for Admin, Manager and Sales Executive users.</p>

<h2>2. Accounts and roles</h2>
<p>Each user holds exactly one primary role. Admin users manage accounts and permissions. Users must keep credentials confidential, use the service only within their assigned scope, and notify the administrator of suspected compromise. Unauthorised access attempts may lead to suspension.</p>

<h2>3. Acceptable use</h2>
<p>Users must not misuse the service, attempt to bypass access controls, submit unlawful content, upload malicious code, or use records for spam in violation of TRAI unsolicited communication rules. Automated scraping without written permission is prohibited.</p>

<h2>4. Data ownership</h2>
<p>CRM data entered by an organisation remains that organisation's data. AcxiomCRM claims no ownership over customer records. On termination, the organisation may request export of its records in CSV form within 30 days, after which routine retention and deletion applies per the Privacy Policy.</p>

<h2>5. Fees</h2>
<p>AcxiomCRM collects no licence fees or payments in this deployment. Any third-party hosting, domain, SMS gateway, or email delivery charges are arranged and paid directly between the organisation and those providers.</p>

<h2>6. Termination and suspension</h2>
<p>Accounts that violate these terms or remain inactive per organisational policy may be suspended or deactivated after notice where practical. Users may request account closure through their administrator or <a href="mailto:support@example.in">support@example.in</a>.</p>

